        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nkingo kaniu khuan gaimei,",
            "Gundai pui tingmik tang the;",
            "Kandih pap nthiammei bam khou,",
            "Nchu njanga suan no.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Kaoliangmei khou kahim daidiu (2),",
            "Tuna nrah khuan gaimei #!7;",
            "Njanga suan na bam e.",
            "",
            "2. Reinung Egypt ram khou kumma,",
            "Jubili guangtang dat the;",
            "Kahim daidiu kaoliangmei khou,",
            "Salem namdai lan lou the.",
            "",
            "3. Hougai e kaniu puan gaimei,",
            "Neihmik khang suang gangai e;",
            "Kaniu phei phuanmei ban lana,",
            "Nchu njang diu tu e.",
            "",
            "4. Gan guang dat ro aniu dang khou,",
            "Nrian loumei ganchuanga;",
            "Jangmei nai diu kabam thui khou,",
            "Tuna lu suan kariu d iu.",
            "",
            "5. Din kaluai datro banchra le,",
            "Tingkauh guang Immanuel;",
            "Kaguang bampang pat lou duna,",
            "Nuan phungmei nun khang guang the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
